<!-- Chosen Palette: Slate & Teal Harmony (Warm slate neutrals, teal/emerald accents, subtle rose highlights) -->
<!-- Application Structure Plan:
  1. Header with ML API Status & Deployment Guide toggle.
  2. Python Backend Integration & Deployment Guide section (explaining where to deploy FastAPI/Python code: Render, Railway, Cloud, Local).
  3. Interactive ML Multi-Scenario Forecasting Dashboard comparing Conservative (+4%p), Baseline (+7%p), and Optimistic (+10%p) scenarios.
  4. Real-time metrics breakdown: Early detection rates, saved life years (QALYs), and net economic savings across all 3 scenarios.
  5. Dynamic Chart.js and Plotly visualizations for multi-scenario comparative trends (2018-2030).
-->
<!-- Visualization & Content Choices:
  - Chart.js Line Chart for Multi-Scenario Epidemiological Trend Forecasting.
  - Chart.js Grouped Bar Chart for 3-Scenario Net Economic Savings Comparison.
  - Chart.js Stacked/Grouped Bar Chart for Saved Quality-Adjusted Life Years (QALYs).
  - Plotly WebGL Cost-Effectiveness Scatter Plot.
  - NO SVG graphics or Mermaid JS used.
-->
<!-- CONFIRMATION: NO SVG graphics used. NO Mermaid JS used. -->

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="kk" class="scroll-smooth">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>OncoScreening ML Болжамдау Жүйесі - 3 Сценарийлік Аналитика</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js"></script>
    <script src="https://cdn.plot.ly/plotly-2.27.0.min.js"></script>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap');
        body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background-color: #f8fafc; color: #0f172a; }
        .chart-container { position: relative; width: 100%; max-width: 650px; margin: 0 auto; height: 320px; max-height: 380px; }
        @media (min-width: 768px) { .chart-container { height: 350px; } }
        .custom-card { background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 0.75rem; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; }
        .stat-card { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e293b 0%, #0f172a 100%); color: #ffffff; }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-50 text-slate-900 antialiased">

    <!-- Header Navigation -->
    <header class="sticky top-0 z-50 bg-slate-900 text-white shadow-lg border-b border-slate-800">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-4">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
                <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-teal-500 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-white text-xl shadow-md">
                    ML
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h1 class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white">OncoScreening ML Forecasting</h1>
                    <p class="text-xs text-teal-400 font-medium">3 Сценарийлі Machine Learning Болжамдау Жүйесі (2018–2030)</p>
                </div>
            </div>
